status: 200
content-security-policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; connect-src 'self'
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>Get ready — Taptime</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css"></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-porcelain text-ink antialiased"><main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-md flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-8"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-tappa-green">taptime</span> <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/70">punchless</span></header><div class="wizard"><nav aria-label="Setup progress"><p class="docket-label">Step <span class="num">3</span> of <span class="num">4</span> · Get ready</p><ol class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5" role="list"><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done"><span class="sr-only">Welcome</span></li><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done"><span class="sr-only">Privacy</span></li><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done" aria-current><span class="sr-only">Get ready</span></li><li class="wizard-segment"><span class="sr-only">Tap</span></li></ol></nav><section class="wizard-panel"><p class="docket-label">Get ready</p><h1 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink">Two quick things before you tap.</h1></section><section class="docket wizard-panel"><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="wizard-index">01</span><div class="font-display"><p class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight">Join the Wi-Fi</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/85">Connect to <span class="num font-bold">KF-StJulians-Staff</span> when you are at work. Being on the venue's network is how Taptime knows you are really there.</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/70">You can skip this. Your taps then use your location instead, and your manager may need to confirm them.</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 flex gap-3 border-t border-dashed border-line pt-5"><span class="wizard-index">02</span><div class="font-display"><p class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight">Stay in this browser</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/85">Your phone remembers you in the browser where you finish setup — and tapping the plaque always opens your phone's usual browser, like Safari or Chrome.</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/85"><span class="font-bold">Opened this link inside a chat or email app?</span> Open it in Safari or Chrome first — look for “Open in browser” in that app's menu — and go through these steps there.</p></div></div></section><div class="wizard-actions"><a href="/activate?step=4" class="tap-button flex items-center justify-center">I'm ready</a> <a href="/activate?step=2" class="wizard-back">Back</a></div></div></main></body></html>